constant_range\"><code>constant_range</code></a>, and <code>U</code> does not model <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/view\"><code>view</code></a>.\n</li><li> otherwise, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">as_const_view<span class=\"br0\">{</span>e<span class=\"br0\">}</span></span></code>.</li></ul></div>\n<p><code>as_const_view</code> always models <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/constant_range\"><code>constant_range</code></a>, and it models the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/contiguous_range\"><code>contiguous_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/random_access_range\"><code>random_access_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/bidirectional_range\"><code>bidirectional_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/forward_range\"><code>forward_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/borrowed_range\"><code>borrowed_range</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><code>common_range</code></a>, and <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/sized_range\"><code>sized_range</code></a> when the underlying view <code>V</code> models respective concepts.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Data_members\">Data members</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td> Member object\n</td>\n<td> Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <span class=\"t-dsc-small\"></span> <code><i>base_</i></code> <span class=\"t-mark\">(private)</span>\n</td>\n<td> The underlying view of type <code>V</code>.<br><span class=\"t-mark t-mark-expos\">(<span>exposition-only member object*</span>)</span>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"#ctor\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs an <code>as_const_view</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"#base\"